127I  cL T$2025LaAA obtained lifetimes using two gating techniques: Gate on     
127I 2cL Transition Above (GTA) and Gate on Transition Below (GTB). The authors 
127I 3cL state that the total systematic error, including the uncertainties in  
127I 4cL target thickness (5%), stopping power values (5%), continuous          
127I 5cL production and stopping of the recoils in the target (<5%), and        
127I 6cL estimation of recoils flying in vacuum (<5%), could at the most be 15%,
127I 7cL which is not included in the quoted error values.                      
